_meanings:
‘The crooked’, <ab>N.</ab> of Chāṇakya, a celebrated writer on
 civil polity, (the work being known as {#cARakyanIti#}), the friend and
 adviser of Chandragupta and a very important character in the Mudrārākṣasa;
 {#kOwilyaH kuwilamatiH sa eza yena kroDAgnO prasaBamadAhi nandavaMSaH#}
 <ls>Mu. 1. 7</ls>; {#spfSati mAM BftyaBAvena kOwilyaSizyaH#} <ls>Mu. 7</ls>.
